%% Berry Exchange — supplementary: reservation flow, buying by the kilogram (concurrency-critical)
sequenceDiagram
    participant Buyer as Buyer (Browser)
    participant API as Reservations API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Buyer->>API: POST /api/listings/{id}/reservations { quantityKg }
    API->>DB: UPDATE listings SET qty_kg = qty_kg - :quantityKg WHERE id = :id AND qty_kg >= :quantityKg
    alt 1 row updated
        DB-->>API: OK
        API->>DB: INSERT reservation (status = Pending)
        DB-->>API: reservation created
        API-->>Buyer: 201 Created
    else 0 rows updated
        DB-->>API: no match
        API-->>Buyer: 409 Conflict "Sold out"
    end
